# Mobile UI

Follow the "Mobile conventions" section of `AGENTS.md`, with the full detail in:

@rules/04-mobile-expo.md
@rules/07-ui-system.md
@rules/28-runtime-validation.md
@rules/27-array-index-readability.md

Reuse the UI kit in `src/ui/` (`@/ui/components/*`, `@/ui/lib/*`) and the app shell in `src/components/` and
`src/features/`; colours come from the tokens in `src/styles/tokens.css`.
